  "description": "An independent audit by real users, with real numbers",
  "body_html": "<p><strong>“What is the StockTok Screener historical performance?”</strong> is a question I get regularly. Its been 77 days and 51 trading days, and now thanks to two community members, who have been tracking the results for all of us, we have some clarity. Here is the answer, and it was not reviewed or cherry picked by me…so no worries about bias here.</p><h3>Historically, the top 3 stocks flagged by the short-term screener have generated cumulative gains of more than 50,000%.</h3><p>Now before you spit up on yourself that it is bullshit…that was my first reaction too 😵‍💫…this does not mean we all made 50,000%. You would have had to invest every single day in the top 3 stock picks, and held perfectly. This obviously, is not feasible. Let me explain what these results really mean…</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GL_e!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fmedia_upload%2Fcomment%2F3eb4a42a-3131-45e0-aa55-9d53a3ea923e%2F509b5065-482c-4231-a2b5-351bae09f9ab.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GL_e!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fmedia_upload%2Fcomment%2F3eb4a42a-3131-45e0-aa55-9d53a3ea923e%2F509b5065-482c-4231-a2b5-351bae09f9ab.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GL_e!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fmedia_upload%2Fcomment%2F3eb4a42a-3131-45e0-aa55-9d53a3ea923e%2F509b5065-482c-4231-a2b5-351bae09f9ab.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GL_e!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-m